# Pool sweep (2026-07-25): the full burned pool under one roll — the ab_off
# tuned 12 (last measured P=1.00 R=0.83 at judge-calibration code, 2026-07-21)
# + the fresh-15 arm 18 (baseline P=0.62 R=0.62). Purpose: breadth regression
# measurement of cycles 1-2d (+ the mechanical identical-drop if its gate run
# passes). Compare per-leg against those two baselines, not the aggregate.
MODEL="gpt-5.4"
COMMON="-n 3 -m 8 --fuzz_timeout 20 --verify_timeout 20 --verify_relations --synthesize_relations --replay_relations_on_patched --rule_compile_repair"
